stay in sync.",[346,347],"component-example",{"name":348},"months-basic",[350,351,352,356,359],"ul",{},[353,354,355],"li",{},"Only non-negative integers are accepted. The value carries over only after focus leaves the whole group (moving focus between years and months does not commit, so both can be cleared together): 0 years 13 months becomes 1 year 1 month, 13 months in total.",[353,357,358],{},"The three bindings can be used alone or together. When the parent fills in total months and years\u002Fmonths that conflict, total months win; when only years\u002Fmonths are filled in, they are summed again and carried over.",[353,360,361,362,365,366,369],{},"An empty side counts as 0; when both are empty, all three bindings are ",[307,363,364],{},"null",". Strings, negative numbers, decimals, ",[307,367,368],{},"NaN"," or values beyond the safe integer range from the parent count as empty.",[331,371,373],{"id":372},"narrow-containers","Narrow containers",[304,375,376],{},"When the container is too narrow for both the years and months inputs, it switches to a single \"total months\" input; with enough width it goes back to both inputs, keeping any input not yet committed.",[346,378],{"name":379},"months-compact",[331,381,383],{"id":382},"variants","Variants",[304,385,386,387,314,390,393,394,397],{},"Uses the ",[307,388,389],{},"color",[307,391,392],{},"highlight"," of ",[307,395,396],{},"UInput",", applied to every input.",[346,399],{"name":400},"months-color",[331,402,404],{"id":403},"size-and-states","Size and states",[304,406,407,408,411],{},"While loading, a spinner shows after the months unit and input is disabled. The year and month units switch with the locale (\"yr\" and \"mo\" in English, \"年\" and \"月\" in Traditional Chinese); their width follows the text, and so does the width needed for the full years and months layout. See ",[320,409,102],{"href":410},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[346,413],{"name":414